# Environmental housing conditions strongly shape microbiome maturation and gut development

R scripts for analyzing gut microbiota, host RNA-seq, and longitudinal body weight across housing facilities, drinking-water treatments, and sexes.

## Repository structure

| Folder | Contents |
| --- | --- |
| `Code/` |  R Markdown files |
| `Data/` | Original data and metadata |
| `Result/` | All results |

## Requirements and data

Analyses were run with R 4.5.3. Main packages include tidyverse, phyloseq, vegan, permute, Maaslin2, DESeq2, AnnotationDbi, org.Mm.eg.db, GO.db, fgsea, mixOmics, nlme, emmeans, and knitr. Recorded package versions are available in sessionInfo of each Markdown file.
